### Pack B4 health
GET http://localhost:5063/api/v5/connectors/runtime-certification/health

### Register mock historian source
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/connectors/runtime-certification/mock-historian/register-source
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerCode": "mock-historian-runtime",
  "displayName": "Mock Historian Runtime Connector",
  "markAsCertifiedProof": false
}

### Read time window
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/connectors/runtime-certification/mock-historian/read-window
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerCode": "mock-historian-runtime",
  "fromUtc": "2026-05-01T08:00:00Z",
  "toUtc": "2026-05-01T08:30:00Z",
  "maxPoints": 500
}

### Backfill interrupted run
POST http://localhost:5063/api/v5/connectors/runtime-certification/backfill/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerCode": "mock-historian-runtime",
  "fromUtc": "2026-05-01T08:00:00Z",
  "toUtc": "2026-05-01T10:00:00Z",
  "batchSize": 100,
  "simulateKillAfterFirstBatch": true
}

### Truth state
GET http://localhost:5063/api/v5/connectors/runtime-certification/truth-state/mock-historian-runtime